Build android sdcard image for Radxa rockpi4b.

   See ../uboot/README to erase SPI flash or place a jumper across GPIO Pin 23 (SPI1_CLK) and Pin 25 (GND).
   cd ~/Downloads
   Download from https://wiki.radxa.com/Rockpi4/downloads
   android: select rock4b Android 11
   wget https://github.com/radxa/manifests/releases/download/Rock-android11-20211115_1851/rockpi-4ab-android11-20211115_1851-gpt.zip
   unzip rockpi-4ab-android11-20211115_1851-gpt.zip

   Plugin sdcard to PC.  
   sudo umount /dev/sda*
   sudo dd if=~/Downloads/Rock-PI-4AB-android11-20211115_1851-gpt.img of=/dev/sda bs=4096 conv=notrunc,fsync status=progress

cd ~/build-5sbc/android
sudo \rm -rf mnt_vendor super.img super_unpacked
sudo dd if=/dev/sda13 of=super.img bs=4M status=progress
mkdir super_unpacked
lpunpack super.img super_unpacked/
mkdir mnt_vendor
sudo mount -o loop,rw super_unpacked/vendor.img mnt_vendor/
echo "service.adb.tcp.port=5555" | sudo tee -a mnt_vendor/build.prop
sync; sudo umount mnt_vendor/
Eject sdcard from PC.

Plugin sdcard to Radxa rockpi4b.
After setting up android, turn on developer mode.
Settings -> About phone -> hit build number 7 times -> back
System -> Advanced -> Developer options -> Open USB debug and wireless debug.
Open google play -> install shutdown
Power -> shutdown

Power on rockpi4b, turn on wireless debug, click on wireless debug and find IP address & port.
adb connect 192.168.86.20:34031
adb devices
adb root
adb shell
du -h /system
mount -o rw,remount /
exit

To install apks:
for pkg in helloworld happybirthday diceroller drawing drawshape kaleidoscope myanalogclock randomsong; do adb push "$pkg.apk" /sdcard/; done
adb shell
cd /system/priv-app
for pkg in helloworld happybirthday diceroller drawing drawshape kaleidoscope myanalogclock randomsong; do ln -sf "/sdcard/$pkg.apk" .; done
exit
for apk in helloworld.apk happybirthday.apk diceroller.apk drawing.apk drawshape.apk kaleidoscope.apk myanalogclock.apk randomsong.apk; do adb install -r "$apk"; done
adb root
adb shell
mount -o ro,remount /
exit

To uninstall apks:
for pkg in helloworld happybirthday diceroller drawing drawshape kaleidoscope myanalogclock randomsong; do adb uninstall "com.example.$pkg"; done
